IIJulylI

00:02:50.546 --> 00:02:52.715
Wow, Honda. You're in everything.

00:02:52.924 --> 00:02:54.008
You can count on me.

00:02:54.217 --> 00:02:54.926
Attention whore.

00:02:55.134 --> 00:02:57.428
No! I was asked to do it.

00:02:57.637 --> 00:02:59.847
| guess that makes me dependable.

00:03:00.056 --> 00:03:01.808
So you're an attention whore.

00:03:02.016 --> 00:03:05.687
That's not what I...

00:03:06.604 --> 00:03:11.484
Huh? We haven't chosen anyone
for the three-legged race.

00:03:11.693 --> 00:03:14.237
Would anyone like to do it?

00:03:14.445 --> 00:03:15.488
Why don't you?

00:03:15.697 --> 00:03:16.698
No way.

00:03:16.906 --> 00:03:19.158
It's too hard.

00:03:25.748 --> 00:03:28.334
Hey, you can run with a girl.

00:03:28.543 --> 00:03:29.252
Are you serious?

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.879
That's even more embarrassing.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.508
Then I'll do it.

00:03:35.717 --> 00:03:38.344
What? Honda's running?

00:03:39.011 --> 00:03:43.474
Huh? Class rep, are you in anything?

00:03:44.475 --> 00:03:48.271
No, right?

00:03:52.108 --> 00:03:55.153
Really? You and Mihashi are
doing the three-legged race?

00:03:55.361 --> 00:03:58.406
It just kind of happened.
It was practically inevitable.

00:03:58.614 --> 00:04:01.826
Good luck to both of us, class rep.

00:04:02.034 --> 00:04:04.245
Um...

00:04:04.454 --> 00:04:06.539
Mihashi doesn't seem into the idea.

00:04:06.748 --> 00:04:07.331
What?

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.791
What are you talking about?

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.793
That's not true, is it?

00:04:12.795 --> 00:04:15.214
Um, Mihashi-san?

00:04:16.132 --> 00:04:20.470
| can't. I'm not athletic.

00:04:20.678 --> 00:04:24.766
It's okay. You won't be alone.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.560
That's even worse.

00:04:27.769 --> 00:04:28.686
What?

00:04:28.895 --> 00:04:30.354
| can't do it.

00:04:30.563 --> 00:04:33.983
| know I'll trip.

00:04:34.192 --> 00:04:39.113
| don't want to bother anyone by
being paired with someone athletic.

00:04:39.322 --> 00:04:41.991
Class rep.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:45.453
It's a good thing you're
paired with Towa, though.

00:04:45.661 --> 00:04:47.163
What do you mean?

00:04:47.371 --> 00:04:49.832
When you're with someone good,
they can pull you through.

00:04:50.041 --> 00:04:51.334
It'll improve your time.

00:04:51.542 --> 00:04:54.295
Really? That's amazing.

00:04:54.504 --> 00:04:56.172
Mihashi-san, what do you think?

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.173
But...

00:04:57.381 --> 00:04:58.466
We'll train.

00:04:58.674 --> 00:04:59.675
What?

00:04:59.884 --> 00:05:01.719
Haruki, train with us.

00:05:01.928 --> 00:05:03.179
Who, me?

00:05:03.387 --> 00:05:04.305
Thanks.

00:05:04.514 --> 00:05:06.808
Wait. Where are we going to practice?

00:05:07.016 --> 00:05:08.392
We can't do it at school.

00:05:08.601 --> 00:05:12.230
Then there's a place I can recommend.

00:05:12.438 --> 00:05:13.648
Oh.

00:05:17.401 --> 00:05:18.569
| see.

00:05:18.778 --> 00:05:21.531
There's no one here.

00:05:24.158 --> 00:05:25.493
What?

00:05:25.701 --> 00:05:29.163
| was just thinking you look
good in your track suit.

00:05:29.372 --> 00:05:31.332
Don't say that right now.

00:05:31.541 --> 00:05:34.293
Why not? You look good.

00:05:34.502 --> 00:05:36.838
| told you not to.

00:05:37.046 --> 00:05:41.467
Running in a three-legged
race is so embarrassing.

00:05:41.676 --> 00:05:43.678
Towa, quit messing around.

00:05:43.886 --> 00:05:45.930
If we don't start soon,
we'll run out of time.

00:05:46.138 --> 00:05:48.349
| know.

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:52.103
So, how are we going to train?

00:05:52.311 --> 00:05:53.729
Here.

00:05:57.984 --> 00:06:00.903
All of this?

00:06:01.112 --> 00:06:03.698
You worked hard on this, Towa.

00:06:03.906 --> 00:06:05.449
It's impossible. I can't do this.

00:06:05.658 --> 00:06:07.034
You can.

00:06:07.243 --> 00:06:11.581
We'll go at your pace.

00:06:11.789 --> 00:06:13.583
We won't get anywhere by complaining.

00:06:13.791 --> 00:06:15.084
We'll start with running.

00:06:15.293 --> 00:06:16.669
Let's go.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.179
Hey... Wait.

00:06:28.556 --> 00:06:31.100
Well, it's what I expected for the first day.

00:06:31.309 --> 00:06:32.310
Huh?

00:06:32.518 --> 00:06:33.978
Mashiki.

00:06:39.942 --> 00:06:41.110
This is good!

00:06:41.319 --> 00:06:42.612
Thanks, Mashiki.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:46.115
It's all I can do to help.

00:06:46.324 --> 00:06:49.285
Mashiki-san, what events
are you participating in?

00:06:49.493 --> 00:06:50.578
| can't.

00:06:50.786 --> 00:06:52.872
I'm not supposed to engage
in strenuous activity.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.832
What?

00:06:57.501 --> 00:06:59.879
Sorry. I didn't know.

00:07:00.087 --> 00:07:01.297
It's okay.

00:07:01.505 --> 00:07:04.300
Besides, I may not be able
to run with everyone,

00:07:04.508 --> 00:07:06.677
but I can still cheer them on.

00:07:11.807 --> 00:07:14.810
When is our class practicing tomorrow?

00:07:15.019 --> 00:07:18.022
We're using our study period.

00:07:19.148 --> 00:07:20.900
Prep committee's here.

00:07:21.108 --> 00:07:23.194
Oh, thanks for coming.

00:07:23.402 --> 00:07:25.529
Could you take these?

00:07:25.738 --> 00:07:28.199
Thanks. I see the handicraft
club's been busy.

00:07:28.407 --> 00:07:29.492
No.

00:07:30.701 --> 00:07:33.037
You're busier than we are.

00:07:33.245 --> 00:07:37.124
That's not true. You're
working hard, Mashiki.

00:07:38.376 --> 00:07:40.169
Thanks.

00:07:42.838 --> 00:07:46.467
| actually wish I could participate more.

00:07:46.676 --> 00:07:49.553
Then you should participate
in whatever way you can.

00:07:49.762 --> 00:07:51.639
Whatever way I can?

00:07:51.847 --> 00:07:53.599
Like what?

00:07:53.808 --> 00:07:56.811
Well, uh...

00:07:58.521 --> 00:08:00.690
What's that thing hanging off your bag?

00:08:00.898 --> 00:08:03.651
What? You mean this?

00:08:03.859 --> 00:08:06.278
Why don't you make charms like that?

00:08:06.487 --> 00:08:08.739
Make one for Haruki.

00:08:08.948 --> 00:08:10.449
Wh-What are you talking about, Towa?

00:08:10.658 --> 00:08:12.076
But don't you want one?

00:08:12.284 --> 00:08:13.995
Wouldn't having one motivate you?

00:08:14.203 --> 00:08:16.038
Yeah, but...

00:08:16.247 --> 00:08:17.206
| mean, anyone would--

00:08:17.415 --> 00:08:19.417
Is that true, Mishima-kun?

00:08:19.625 --> 00:08:20.376
What?

00:08:20.584 --> 00:08:24.296
Do you think people like charms?

00:08:24.505 --> 00:08:25.589
Uh, yeah.

00:08:25.798 --> 00:08:29.051
Of course! They're super motivating!

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:30.678
Then I'll make some.

00:08:30.886 --> 00:08:33.639
I'll make some for the entire
class by the sports festival.

00:08:33.848 --> 00:08:36.892
What? The entire class?

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:45.609
Mashiki-san's doing that?

00:08:45.818 --> 00:08:47.069
Will she be okay?

00:08:47.278 --> 00:08:49.071
She's pushing herself too hard.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.824
| guess she is.

00:08:52.033 --> 00:08:53.576
You think it'll be hard?

00:08:53.784 --> 00:08:56.412
Well, yeah.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:09:01.333
Mashiki-san must have really
wanted to participate.

00:09:02.752 --> 00:09:04.670
| should work harder, too.

00:09:04.879 --> 00:09:06.422
Awesome, class rep!

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:08.132
Should we train even harder?

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.175
Not that.

00:09:09.383 --> 00:09:12.386
What? Why not?

00:09:13.888 --> 00:09:16.140
Prep committee here.

00:09:19.226 --> 00:09:20.686
This is all we collected.

00:09:20.895 --> 00:09:21.896
Thanks.

00:09:22.104 --> 00:09:23.773
Huh? Where's the other guy?

00:09:23.981 --> 00:09:27.777
Apparently he's busy.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:30.988
Oh, Mashiki-san?

00:09:31.197 --> 00:09:34.950
She said she still has more to do.

00:09:39.872 --> 00:09:41.082
Thank you.

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:43.000
Thanks.

00:09:47.713 --> 00:09:49.632
All right.

00:09:50.216 --> 00:09:52.635
Oh, crap. I'm late.

00:09:57.681 --> 00:10:00.476
Yeah, I have practice again today.

00:10:00.684 --> 00:10:04.939
| know. I'll call you when I'm leaving.

00:10:08.109 --> 00:10:09.610
Honda-kun.

00:10:09.819 --> 00:10:12.446
Uh, sorry I'm late.

00:10:12.655 --> 00:10:14.698
Let's get started.

00:10:14.907 --> 00:10:17.785
Mishima, could you check on
the equipment in storage?

00:10:17.993 --> 00:10:19.078
Okay.

00:10:19.286 --> 00:10:21.455
Take Asumi with you.

00:10:21.664 --> 00:10:22.915
He's off right now.

00:10:23.124 --> 00:10:24.583
Oh, right.

00:10:24.792 --> 00:10:27.711
Is there anyone else who can help?

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.840
That's okay. I'll do it myself.

00:10:31.048 --> 00:10:34.635
Thanks. I wish we could find
you a new partner, but...

00:10:34.844 --> 00:10:35.803
It's fine.

00:10:36.011 --> 00:10:38.139
You can keep giving me more work.

00:10:38.347 --> 00:10:39.807
How dependable.

00:10:40.015 --> 00:10:42.893
As long as I'm doing this,
I'd like it to be a success.

00:10:43.102 --> 00:10:45.521
Thanks. Work hard.

00:10:45.729 --> 00:10:47.106
| will.

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:10.045
You're going fast today.

00:11:10.254 --> 00:11:11.297
| did some research.

00:11:11.505 --> 00:11:16.844
Apparently, it's important to
match your partner's breathing.

00:11:17.052 --> 00:11:21.182
So I'm trying to keep up.

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:26.395
Then I'll match yours.

00:11:26.604 --> 00:11:28.397
Don't overdo it.

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:34.612
There's no point if you hurt yourself.

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:36.697
Let's go!

00:11:37.656 --> 00:11:39.241
Okay.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:03.432
Let's start slowly.

00:12:03.641 --> 00:12:05.893
| can't.

00:12:06.101 --> 00:12:07.436
It's how the race works.

00:12:07.645 --> 00:12:09.939
You have to get used to it.

00:12:10.147 --> 00:12:10.856
| can't.

00:12:11.065 --> 00:12:13.275
That's why we're practicing.

00:12:13.484 --> 00:12:15.653
Run in time with my voice.

00:12:15.861 --> 00:12:16.820
Fine.

00:12:17.029 --> 00:12:19.615
Here we go. Tied foot first.

00:12:19.823 --> 00:12:20.950
Ready, and...

00:12:21.158 --> 00:12:24.328
One, two. One, two.

00:12:33.379 --> 00:12:34.880
Are you okay?

00:12:35.089 --> 00:12:37.049
Y-Yeah.

00:12:37.258 --> 00:12:38.175
I'll wait.

00:12:38.384 --> 00:12:39.051
What?

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:42.179
We can go when you're ready.

00:13:08.872 --> 00:13:10.541
Let's try it again.

00:13:10.749 --> 00:13:11.959
Ready, and...

00:13:12.167 --> 00:13:16.714
One, two. One, two. One, two.

00:13:20.801 --> 00:13:21.719
How is it?

00:13:21.927 --> 00:13:23.721
Delicious!

00:13:25.681 --> 00:13:29.059
This is next.

00:13:29.268 --> 00:13:31.270
Haruki, how are the preparations coming along?

00:13:31.478 --> 00:13:33.147
I'm fine. Leave it to me.

00:13:33.355 --> 00:13:34.398
Anyway, how are you guys doing?

00:13:34.606 --> 00:13:37.943
We're great. We're bound
by a common destiny.

00:13:38.152 --> 00:13:40.988
What are you talking about? Sheesh.

00:13:42.072 --> 00:13:43.866
Are you two practicing after this?

00:13:44.074 --> 00:13:45.117
Yeah.

00:13:45.326 --> 00:13:47.119
Good luck, Mihashi-san.

00:13:47.328 --> 00:13:49.079
Yeah. You, too.

00:13:49.288 --> 00:13:51.540
Let's go, class rep.

00:14:05.596 --> 00:14:06.972
What?

00:14:08.307 --> 00:14:11.310
Sorry. Practice ran late.

00:14:17.232 --> 00:14:19.234
Just dry your hair.

00:14:19.443 --> 00:14:20.819
We're going shopping.

00:14:21.028 --> 00:14:22.029
Shopping?

00:14:22.237 --> 00:14:24.656
You need a break.

00:14:25.908 --> 00:14:27.409
Right!

00:14:30.162 --> 00:14:31.455
Hey.

00:14:31.663 --> 00:14:34.041
This is from the student council.

00:14:35.209 --> 00:14:36.251
Oh, great!

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.087
Awesome!

00:14:47.513 --> 00:14:49.264
Thanks.

00:14:49.473 --> 00:14:50.849
Sure.

00:14:52.267 --> 00:14:55.813
One, two. One, two. One, two. One, two.

00:14:56.021 --> 00:14:57.564
One, two. One, two.

00:14:57.773 --> 00:15:01.777
One, two. One, two. One, two. One, two.

