"The Merman Prince"

00:15:34.726 --> 00:15:36.353
Thanks for waiting!

00:15:36.562 --> 00:15:38.188
It's finally ready!

00:15:38.397 --> 00:15:39.273
This is amazing.

00:15:39.481 --> 00:15:40.065
Isn't it?

00:15:40.274 --> 00:15:41.692
Sanagi made this?

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:44.570
Yeah. It was really good!

00:15:44.778 --> 00:15:45.362
| see.

00:15:45.571 --> 00:15:46.697
Yeah.

00:15:46.905 --> 00:15:49.116
Looks good.

00:15:52.244 --> 00:15:54.246
"32nd Aokisora High School Sports Festival”

00:15:59.126 --> 00:16:00.002
Where's Mashiki?

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.129
| haven't seen her yet.

00:16:02.337 --> 00:16:03.297
Really?

00:16:03.505 --> 00:16:05.424
Good morning.

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:10.304
Mashiki-san, is that...

00:16:13.474 --> 00:16:15.434
Gather round, class 3!

00:16:15.642 --> 00:16:17.561
What?

00:16:17.769 --> 00:16:19.563
Uh, I made these.

00:16:19.771 --> 00:16:21.482
Huh? Charms?

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.317
Mashiki made them.

00:16:23.525 --> 00:16:24.443
They're so cute!

00:16:24.651 --> 00:16:26.195
What? We can have them?

00:16:26.403 --> 00:16:28.947
Yeah, they're for everyone.

00:16:29.156 --> 00:16:29.948
Thanks!

00:16:30.157 --> 00:16:32.034
We'll hand these out to everyone.

00:16:32.242 --> 00:16:33.619
Yeah.

00:16:35.496 --> 00:16:36.914
That's great.

00:16:37.122 --> 00:16:38.207
Yeah.

00:16:38.415 --> 00:16:39.833
The starting ceremony's soon.

00:16:40.042 --> 00:16:41.126
Let's go.

00:16:41.335 --> 00:16:44.463
Oh, wait a minute.

00:16:44.671 --> 00:16:46.215
Here. These are for you.

00:16:46.423 --> 00:16:47.883
What? You made some for us?

00:16:48.091 --> 00:16:49.384
Of course.

00:16:49.593 --> 00:16:51.220
Thanks, Mashiki-san!

00:16:51.428 --> 00:16:52.679
Good luck.

00:16:52.888 --> 00:16:54.014
Thanks.

00:17:00.562 --> 00:17:02.147
Thanks.

00:17:05.275 --> 00:17:12.658
The 32nd Aokisora High School
Sports Festival will now begin.

00:17:30.717 --> 00:17:32.553
Non-chan, should we take these over there?

00:17:32.761 --> 00:17:33.845
Yeah, thanks.

00:17:34.054 --> 00:17:35.764
Sanagi-kun.

00:17:36.473 --> 00:17:37.724
Mashiki-san.

00:17:37.933 --> 00:17:40.060
You made lunch.

00:17:40.269 --> 00:17:42.521
Yeah, we're almost ready to open.

00:17:42.729 --> 00:17:44.022
Good luck.

00:17:44.231 --> 00:17:46.483
Thanks.

00:17:46.692 --> 00:17:48.443
Are you okay?

00:17:48.652 --> 00:17:50.320
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:17:50.529 --> 00:17:53.657
| know! Mashiki-san, could
you do something for us?

00:17:53.865 --> 00:17:55.284
What?

00:17:55.701 --> 00:17:57.077
Welcome, welcome!

00:17:57.286 --> 00:17:59.621
Would you like a delicious lunch?

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:00.998
Two, please.

00:18:01.206 --> 00:18:02.082
Here you go.

00:18:02.291 --> 00:18:03.292
Thanks for coming!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:06.461
If you don't hurry, they'll be gone!

00:18:13.135 --> 00:18:16.138
The afternoon events are starting soon.

00:18:16.346 --> 00:18:19.016
This is really good.

00:18:19.224 --> 00:18:21.685
All that food will feel
heavy in your stomach.

00:18:21.893 --> 00:18:25.397
Shall we get going?

00:18:25.606 --> 00:18:27.566
The grade-based relay is starting.

00:18:27.774 --> 00:18:31.403
It's going to be a showdown between the
student council president and Sakurakoji-senpai.

00:18:33.363 --> 00:18:35.198
It's almost time.

00:18:35.407 --> 00:18:37.743
You'll be fine. You practiced hard.

00:18:37.951 --> 00:18:39.661
Have a little faith.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:41.830
In you?

00:18:42.039 --> 00:18:44.791
In yourself, class rep.

00:18:47.502 --> 00:18:50.255
See? Mashiki's cheering you on.

00:18:51.757 --> 00:18:53.884
You're right.

00:18:57.596 --> 00:18:59.348
You can do it, Towa!

00:18:59.556 --> 00:19:01.516
Mihashi-san!

00:19:01.892 --> 00:19:03.810
On your marks.

00:19:04.019 --> 00:19:06.563
Get set!

00:19:28.794 --> 00:19:30.337
Class rep!

00:19:30.545 --> 00:19:31.797
Way to go!

00:19:32.005 --> 00:19:33.465
Not bad, class rep!

00:19:33.674 --> 00:19:36.510
Class rep, you were great!

00:19:37.511 --> 00:19:38.970
Um...

00:19:39.179 --> 00:19:42.808
See? You're amazing!

00:19:46.019 --> 00:19:48.271
I'm glad.

00:19:51.233 --> 00:19:52.693
Bye.

00:19:52.901 --> 00:19:54.695
See you tomorrow.

00:19:57.614 --> 00:19:59.491
Hey.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:01.368
Mashiki.

00:20:02.494 --> 00:20:05.288
Haruki, I'll handle the rest.

00:20:06.915 --> 00:20:09.918
Sorry. You still had more to clean up.

00:20:10.127 --> 00:20:12.421
We were mostly finished.

00:20:12.629 --> 00:20:15.549
Anyway, Towa said he'd handle it.

00:20:15.757 --> 00:20:17.551
| see.

00:20:19.511 --> 00:20:22.305
Uh, thanks for the charm.

00:20:22.514 --> 00:20:25.142
No, I should be thanking you.

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:26.601
What?

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:32.482
I've never really been
involved in sports festivals.

00:20:32.691 --> 00:20:36.570
| thought it couldn't be helped
and had given up on it.

00:20:36.778 --> 00:20:41.783
But you created an opportunity
for me to do something.

00:20:41.992 --> 00:20:45.287
It felt as if I participated
for the first time.

00:20:45.495 --> 00:20:47.247
| see.

00:20:48.749 --> 00:20:49.833
Rain?

00:20:50.041 --> 00:20:52.085
Mashiki, over there.

00:20:56.339 --> 00:20:59.050
We can't go anywhere like this.

00:21:08.977 --> 00:21:10.520
What's wrong?

00:21:11.021 --> 00:21:13.940
It's nothing.

00:21:24.534 --> 00:21:25.911
Here.

00:21:27.496 --> 00:21:29.039
Thanks.

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:18.839
Another city light blinks out

00:22:19.047 --> 00:22:28.682
Seems I'm the only one
being left behind like this

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:37.399
I leaned in close to the light
of the vending machine

00:22:37.607 --> 00:22:46.533
And bought something
other than my usual coffee

00:22:46.741 --> 00:22:51.204
I wonder if I can be myself

00:22:51.413 --> 00:22:57.252
From now on, and even further beyond

00:22:58.378 --> 00:23:07.345
Surely someday we'll come
to know sadness as love

00:23:07.554 --> 00:23:16.688
Reconnecting somewhere
and parting again, over and over

00:23:16.897 --> 00:23:30.452
Surely the day will come when we're
all too used to feeling joy

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:37.000
Call that happiness

00:23:39.961 --> 00:23:41.004
"Next Time"

00:23:41.004 --> 00:23:45.467
"Next Time"
August, when the sun is scorching hot.

00:23:45.467 --> 00:23:45.675
"Next Time"

00:23:45.675 --> 00:23:49.554
"Next Time" Her straw hat waving
in the wind raises his temperature.

00:23:49.554 --> 00:23:49.763
"Next Time"

00:23:49.763 --> 00:23:53.892
"Next Time" The chirping of the
cicadas excites her wavering heart.

00:23:53.892 --> 00:23:54.100
"Next Time"

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:56.186
"Next Time" On nights when
giant flowers blossom in the sky,

00:23:56.186 --> 00:23:56.394
"Next Time"

00:23:56.394 --> 00:23:58.063
"Next Time"
their hearts cross paths,

00:23:58.063 --> 00:23:58.271
"Next Time"

00:23:58.271 --> 00:24:01.858
"Next Time" and the resulting
friction creates even more warmth.

00:24:01.858 --> 00:24:02.067
"Next Time"

00:24:02.067 --> 00:24:04.277
